Number and type of tabs need to be logical based on Contractor's approach. The Hardware tab to include the following:
Identify supplier or manufacturer name, Commercial and Government Entity (CAGE) code, and address;
Components by Part Number, Serial Number and Item Name;
Identify whether identified hardware is a test or production article, spare, developmental item;
Identify hardware pedigree, quality level and qualification status;
Identify associated dates (e.g., delivery, install, removal, storage etc.);
Identify hardware planned to be reused or destroyed through testing in order to track the pedigree, cycles, and heritage of a unit under test through each planned test event;
Include location where assets are needed and/or to be delivered.
